ease status stays separate from order status.') }}</p></article><article><span>03</span><i class="fas fa-truck"></i><strong>SHIP / RETURN</strong><p>{{ l('从配送页查看承运进度与退换入口。','Open shipping to review carrier progress and return entry points.') }}</p></article></div><section class="wo-support-orders"><button v-for="order in orders" :key="order.id" :data-testid="`shopping-service-order-${order.id}`" @click="emit('open-order',order.id)"><span>{{ order.id.slice(-6).toUpperCase() }}</span><strong>{{ order.items.map(x=>x.title).join(' / ') }}</strong><b>OPEN →</b></button></section></section></main></template>
